{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","雷光剑影"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","雷光剣影"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","对范围内进行数次快速攻击，并进入“充盈”状态。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","範囲内に攻撃を複数回行い、「活性」状態に入る"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","选择一个格子，对该格子和其周围1格范围内的区域进行7次神速斩击，每次斩击会对区域内的全体敌人造成70% + 10% ATK伤害，且斩击期间自身处于无敌状态。斩击结束后，使自身进入“充盈”状态，持续12秒。在“充盈”状态下，自身提高20%的攻击力。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","マスを1つ選択し、そのマスと周囲1マス内に、神速斬撃を7回行う。各斬撃で範囲内の敵全体に70% + 10% ATKのダメージを与える。斬撃中は無敵状態で、斬撃が終わると、12秒間の「活性」状態に入る。「活性」状態のヴァレンは、攻撃力+20%"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":51,"end":57,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":47,"end":53,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":48,"end":61,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":73,"end":75,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":44,"end":57,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":71,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"keyword:invincible"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至75% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが75% + 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":8,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":5,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":5,"end":18,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","伤害提升至80% + 10% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","ダメージが80% + 10% ATKにUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","p